		{
			dependencies: ["1523A7C10CEF69AA"]
			description: [
				"&6 Suit Up for the Stars&r"
				""
				"Before you set foot on the &fMoon&r, you’ll need more than just courage-you’ll need a fully equipped &bspace suit&r built to withstand the &cdangers of the void&r."
				""
				"The Moon has no oxygen, &4no atmosphere&r, and temperatures that would freeze or scorch the unprepared. Without protection, you won’t survive more than a few moments. Your only defense? A &lcomplete Ad Astra Space Suit&r."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Craft the helmet, chestplate, leggings, and boots, and ensure they're equipped and pressurized before launch. This suit is more than gear-it’s your &9lifeline&r among the stars."
				""
				"Only the fully suited survive. Are you ready to breathe among the craters?"
			]
