		{
			dependencies: ["6169F8EB0E600750"]
			description: [
				" &cTier 2 Rocket: Breaking Mars’ Orbit&r"
				""
				"Mars lies farther across the void than the Moon-and reaching it demands more than just ambition. Your &7Tier 1 Rocket&r served you well, but it lacks the &cfuel capacity&r and &cengine power&r to brave the longer journey."
				""
				"To pierce the Martian skies, you’ll need to &lupgrade&r to a &cTier 2 Rocket&r-engineered for deeper space, tougher conditions, and greater resilience. This next step in your &ointerstellar journey&r marks a turning point in your cosmic legacy."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lGather rare materials, refine your designs, and prepare for the power of a true planetary vessel.&r  "
				"The stars are calling once again."
				""
				"Learn how to craft the &cTier 2 Rocket&r in its  "
				"{ \"text\": \"Dedicated Chapter\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"blue\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"67026EE366909C22\" } }"
			]
