		{
			dependencies: ["2D130C99B5D7C5FF"]
			description: [
				" &4Digging Deeper: Martian Foundations&r"
				""
				"Before you build among the stars, you must carve your place into the Martian dust. Mars may appear lifeless, but its crimson crust is rich with &cMartian Stone&r-an essential material for constructing outposts and unlocking advanced planetary tech."
				""
				"This versatile resource is not just for walls-it’s the key to &lreinforced builds&r, &odecorative architecture&r, and the foundations of your future Martian empire."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Begin your excavation and gather what you need to &orest&r, &odevelop&r, and &ouncover the secrets&r buried beneath the red sands. Some of the &6rare minerals&r that lie beneath may change your journey forever."
				""
				" &lYour Martian colony begins with a single stone.&r"
			]
			icon: "ad_astra:mars_stone"
			id: "11B8EF9631422774"
