			description: [
				" &cMercury: Trial by Fire&r"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/mercury_screenshot.png width:565 height:400 align:center fit:true}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Mercury is not a land of welcome-it is a crucible of &cscorching heat&r, &obarren terrain&r, and &6relentless solar fury&r. With no natural ores to harvest, every moment spent here is a trial of endurance and resilience."
				""
				"Yet, amid the &oblighted surface&r lies a structure of immense significance: &lthe Burning Arena&r-&oa fiery coliseum of chaos, mystery, and rare spoils&r. It is the planet’s only landmark, and it holds challenges that few return from unscathed."
				""
				"Before you descend into the inferno, ensure you’ve &lprepared for the worst&r. &cHeat resistance, oxygen, and powerful gear&r are your only allies here. Mercury does not forgive mistakes."
				""
				" Will you endure the flame-or be consumed by it?"
			]
