		{
			dependencies: ["767ED8F286B517B6"]
			description: [
				" &6Forge the Flameproof Suit&r"
				""
				"Mercury’s searing heat makes it one of the most unforgiving worlds in the entire solar system. The moment you leave your rocket, the planet's atmosphere will try to cook you alive. &cWithout the right protection, you won’t survive long enough to take a step!&r"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"To endure this &ohellish environment&r, you’ll need the &lNetherite Space Suit&r-a reinforced upgrade designed to withstand the sun-scorched landscape. This suit isn't just an armor piece-it’s your lifeline."
				""
				"Crafting the Netherite Space Suit is not optional-it’s your &cfinal barrier between survival and ash&r."
				""
				" *Forge the flameshield, face the heat, and claim Mercury’s challenge head-on!*"
			]
