		{
			dependencies: ["08573BBF32BBB660"]
			description: [
				"Venus is a world of &dpoisoned skies&r, &oflaming winds&r, and &6unrelenting electrical fury&r."
				"{image:ftb:textures/venus_screenshot.png width:565 height:400 align:center fit:true}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"This is not just a new frontier-it’s a battlefield where the very air seeks to bring your journey to an end."
				""
				"Unlike Mars or the Moon, Venus is a land of extremes with &ono natural ores&r and &ccorrosive storms that never cease&r. But beneath the sulfuric haze lie the ruins of a &olegend long lost to flame and thunder&r. What secrets will you uncover beneath the ash?"
				""
				"&lOnly those clad in Netherite and armed with courage&r will survive the descent. With your &bTier 3 Rocket&r and &8Netherite Space Suit&r, you are among the first to step onto this hostile ground."
				""
				" &dWill you master the storm-or be swept away by it?&r"
			]
