		{
			dependencies: ["25721A33E1238EBD"]
			description: [
				"The scorching &6hellscape of Venus&r is among the most unforgiving planets in the system. Its atmosphere is a &ounrelenting furnace&r, torn by &cvicious storms&r and laced with &dpoisonous clouds&r that test the limits of both technology and survival."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"To walk upon this cursed land, you’ll need more than bravery-&lyou’ll need the best gear science can offer&r. Only the &bTier 3 Rocket&r and the &8Netherite Space Suit&r can shield you from Venus’ &cexplosive heat&r and &6hostile terrain&r."
				""
				"&lWithout proper preparation, you will not survive&r. Gather your supplies, &oreinforce your protections&r, and &lbrace for a descent into planetary chaos&r."
				""
				" &dCan you endure the fury of Venus-or be vaporized by it?&r"
