		{
			dependencies: ["66B44ACF05B64947"]
			description: [
				"Beneath the searing crust of Venus, &otwo extraordinary resources&r pulse with raw energy-awaiting only the boldest miners to claim them."
				""
				"- &6Calorite Ore&r – A durable, high-performance metal, essential for &ladvanced machinery&r and &ointerplanetary tech&r.  "
				"- &cPyroclast Ore&r – A volatile mineral infused with intense heat, used to enhance energy systems-and &oprocessed into Calorite&r for high-tier crafting."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"These ores are &rthe heart of Venus’s technological potential&r, but reaching them is no small feat. The molten terrain &lshifts beneath your feet&r, heat threatens to overwhelm, and pockets of lava lie hidden in wait."
				""
				"Suit up, mine deep, and &cclaim the flame-born treasures&r of Venus-if you can survive long enough to use them."
