		{
			dependencies: ["094EA96520B42095"]
			description: [
				"&b Glacio, the frozen wastelands&r"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/glacio_screenshot.png width:565 height:400 align:center fit:true}"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"The instant your ship touches down, you feel it-&9Glacio&r is no ordinary world. It is a realm of &bfrostbitten silence&r, where &ojagged ice peaks&r loom and &obiting winds&r carve through ancient stone."
				""
				"Armed with your &lTier 4 Rocket&r and &lcutting-edge survival gear&r, you are among the elite few who dare to set foot here. But survival is only the beginning."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Beneath the shimmering ice and glacial cliffs lie:"
				""
				"- &bFrostite&r – a rare mineral hidden deep in the frost.  "
				"- &bGlacio Ice Shards&r – essential for advanced crafting.  "
				"- &7Ancient, frozen ruins&r – brimming with forgotten power and secrets."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Yet, danger lurks in the cold. The &oguardians of Glacio&r are as merciless as the weather, and only those with &lresilience and preparation&r will uncover the truth buried beneath the snow."
				""
				" &oWill you forge ahead-or be frozen in time?&r"
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			hide_dependent_lines: true
			icon: "ad_astra:glacio_globe"
			id: "05B5C7A592D2E3DA"
			rewards: [{
