		{
			dependencies: ["05B5C7A592D2E3DA"]
			description: [
				"You’ve conquered the &cscorching fury of Venus&r-now brace yourself for the &bglacial silence of Glacio&r. This frozen world is both breathtaking and brutal, where every step across its icy surface tests your resolve."
				""
				"To set foot on this frigid frontier, you’ll need a &lTier 4 Rocket&r-crafted from the &rrare ores of &6Venus&r and &4Mars&r. But even the finest technology offers no comfort from the biting winds and hidden dangers that await."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Prepare for a new era of exploration as you uncover:"
				""
				"- &bFrostite Ore&r – a frost-hardened material found only on Glacio  "
				"- &bGlacio Ice Shards&r – crystalline remnants infused with chilling energy  "
				"- &7Ancient structures&r buried beneath the snow, guarding powerful secrets"
				""
				" &oThe cold does not forgive the unprepared. Will you master the frost-or fall to its silence?&r"
			]
