				"With &bGlacio’s frozen frontier&r behind you, a new challenge begins. The path forward leads not into the stars, but deep below-to the realm of shadows and silence. It’s time to descend into the &8Deep Dark&r, face the &cWarden&r, and uncover the secret to unlocking the End."
