		{
			dependencies: ["1523A7C10CEF69AA"]
			description: [
				"&7With the Moon now behind you, humanity’s next great challenge awaits among the crimson sands of Mars.&r"
				""
				"Your journey deeper into the stars continues with the construction of the &cTier 2 Rocket&r, a far more advanced spacecraft designed to endure the dangers of interplanetary travel. Reaching Mars will demand stronger materials, greater automation, and a factory capable of supporting an expanding space program."
				""
				"Every machine you improve and every resource you refine pushes you closer to setting foot on another world."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lEngineering for Mars&r:"
				"Unlike your first rocket, the &cTier 2 Rocket&r requires significantly more advanced engineering and infrastructure. The harsh environment of deep space demands reinforced plating, upgraded propulsion systems, and highly specialized components capable of surviving the long journey to Mars."
				""
				"Your growing factory must now operate on an entirely new scale, producing the machinery and materials necessary to support humanity’s expansion beyond the Moon."
				""
				"Automation, exploration, and technological progression will all play a critical role in completing this monumental achievement."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"As the final systems come online and your new rocket stands prepared upon the launch pad, one thing becomes clear:"
				""
				"This is no longer a simple mission to reach space."
				""
				"It is the beginning of interplanetary exploration."
			]
