		{
			dependencies: ["1523A7C10CEF69AA"]
			description: [
				"Once a shining testament to the ingenuity of the Lunarians, the Ancient Factory upon the Moon now stands silent and abandoned."
				""
				"Over the centuries, its halls have fallen into ruin, consumed by darkness and overtaken by &cThe Harbinger&r and its legion of corrupted machines. These demonic constructs now patrol the factory’s shattered corridors, protecting the secrets and riches left behind by a forgotten civilization."
				""
				"Will you rise to reclaim the Ancient Factory and uncover what still remains within?"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/ancient_factory_bg.png width:225 height:175 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Before you can confront &cThe Harbinger&r, you must first defeat its relentless guardian: &4The Prowler&r."
				""
				"This deadly machine stands as the final barrier between you and the heart of the factory. Defeat it, press deeper into the ruins, and prepare yourself for the battle ahead."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"To awaken &cThe Harbinger&r, a powerful offering is required."
				""
				"You must sacrifice a &6Nether Star&r - a relic obtained by defeating the &8Wither&r. Approach the dormant form of The Harbinger and right-click it while holding the Nether Star to begin the encounter."
				""
				"Once awakened, the factory will tremble as the battle begins."
				""
				"Defeating The Harbinger rewards you with rare &cWitherite&r, a powerful material capable of being forged into advanced weaponry worthy of the challenges yet to come."
			]
